      <reaction compartment="compartment_17951" fast="false" id="reaction_193736" metaid="metaid_57" name="Isomerization of 3,7,24THCA-CoA to (24R, 25R) 3alpha,7alpha,24-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The isomerization of 3,7,24THCA-CoA to (24R, 25R) 3alpha,7alpha,24-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoyl-CoA, catalyzed by 2-methylacyl-CoA racemase, occurs in the peroxisomal matrix.</p>
        </notes>
