      <reaction compartment="compartment_70101" fast="false" id="reaction_193711" metaid="metaid_63" name="3,7,24THCA is conjugated with Coenzyme A (SLC27A5 BACS)" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">3,7,24THCA (25(R) 3alpha,7alpha,24(S)-trihydroxy-5beta-cholestanoate), coenzyme A, and ATP react to form the CoA conjugate of 3,7,24THCA, AMP, pyrophosphate and water. This cytosolic reaction is catalyzed by SLC27A5 (BACS). SLC27A2 (VLCS) also catalyzes this reaction; the relative contributions of the two enzymes to de novo bile acid synthesis in vivo are not certain (Mihalik et al. 2002).</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
