      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193787" metaid="metaid_68" name="5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24(S)-tetrol is hydroxylated to 5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24(S), 27-pentol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24(S)-tetrol, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 5beta-cholestan-3alpha,7alpha,12alpha,24(S),27-pentol, NADP+, and H2O. This reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
