      <reaction compartment="compartment_5460" fast="false" id="reaction_193792" metaid="metaid_81" name="CYP27A1 27-hydroxylates 5β-CHOL3α,7α,24(s)-triol" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <p xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">5β-cholestan-3α,7α,24(S)-triol, NADPH + H+, and O2 react to form 5β-cholestan-3α,7α,24(S),27-tetrol, NADP+, and H2O. This reaction occurs in the mitochondrial matrix, catalyzed by CYP27A1.</p>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" xmlns:vCard="http://www.w3.org/2001/vcard-rdf/3.0#" xmlns:dcterms="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" xmlns:bqbiol="http://biomodels.net/biology-qualifiers/">
